                                "sense_id": "1b4c3fdb-3e20-36c1-9069-72c5be572ae7",
                                "text": "1997: Nor could I have dreamed the heteroclite crew-men I had met aboard Tzadkiel's ship ... — Gene Wolfe, The Urth of the New Sun"
                            },
